      "text": "%md\n### Iteratively updating a plot\n\nYou may have noticed that each matplotlib figure instance gets closed immediately after its shown. To fix this, we set the `close` property to `False` in our configuration.\n\nAlso, to iteratively update a single plot, we can leverage Zeppelin\u0027s built-in Angular Display System. To enable this, we must set a special `angular` flag to `True` in our configuration.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
